(7647783, 1243351, 124815, '<td valign="top">First image that I opened in this challenge. We hound same places. How could one not?<br/> <br/>We had different approaches and my picture goes some years back:<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1243564" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/120000-124999/124815/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1243564.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/120000-124999/124815/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1243564.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/120000-124999/124815/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1243564.jpg"/></a> <br/>Good pp on the statue but I find the background too dark and I personally would have cropped some of the top and enhance the horizontality of the image.<br/> <br/>will vote later</td>', 'First image that I opened in this challenge. We hound same places. How could one not? We had different approaches and my picture goes some years back: Good pp on the statue but I find the background too dark and I personally would have cropped some of the top and enhance the horizontality of the image. will vote later', '2019-12-04 10:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
